                    <h2 id="authentication-POSTapi-v1-auth-forgot-password">Forgot password</h2>

<p>
</p>

<p>Send a password reset link to the given email address.
The link will expire after 60 minutes.</p>

<span id="example-requests-POSTapi-v1-auth-forgot-password">
<blockquote>Example request:</blockquote>


<div class="bash-example">
    <pre><code class="language-bash">curl --request POST \
    "http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/auth/forgot-password" \
    --header "Content-Type: application/json" \
    --header "Accept: application/json" \
    --data "{
    \"email\": \"john@example.com\"
}"
</code></pre></div>


