                    <h2 id="seller-application-GETapi-v1-seller-application-status">Check application status</h2>

<p>
<small class="badge badge-darkred">requires authentication</small>
</p>

<p>Get the current status of the authenticated user's seller application.
Returns application details and current review status.</p>

<span id="example-requests-GETapi-v1-seller-application-status">
<blockquote>Example request:</blockquote>


<div class="bash-example">
    <pre><code class="language-bash">curl --request GET \
    --get "http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/seller-application/status" \
    --header "Authorization: Bearer {YOUR_API_TOKEN}" \
    --header "Content-Type: application/json" \
    --header "Accept: application/json"</code></pre></div>


<div class="javascript-example">
    <pre><code class="language-javascript">const url = new URL(
    "http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/seller-application/status"
);

const headers = {
    "Authorization": "Bearer {YOUR_API_TOKEN}",
    "Content-Type": "application/json",
    "Accept": "application/json",
};

fetch(url, {
    method: "GET",
    headers,
}).then(response =&gt; response.json());</code></pre></div>

</span>

