                <h1 id="seller-tickets">Seller Tickets</h1>

    <p>Manage support tickets assigned to the authenticated seller.
Sellers can view tickets from their customers, reply to them,
and add internal notes visible only to staff.</p>

                                <h2 id="seller-tickets-GETapi-v1-seller-tickets">List seller&#039;s tickets</h2>

<p>
<small class="badge badge-darkred">requires authentication</small>
</p>

