                <h1 id="contact">Contact</h1>

    <p>APIs for the website contact form. Users can submit messages
without authentication.</p>

                                <h2 id="contact-POSTapi-v1-contact">Submit contact message</h2>

<p>
</p>

<p>Send a message through the website's contact form.
Messages are stored and visible to admins for review and reply.</p>

<span id="example-requests-POSTapi-v1-contact">
<blockquote>Example request:</blockquote>


<div class="bash-example">
    <pre><code class="language-bash">curl --request POST \
    "http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/contact" \
    --header "Content-Type: application/json" \
    --header "Accept: application/json" \
    --data "{
    \"name\": \"John Doe\",
    \"email\": \"john@example.com\",
    \"phone\": \"+1234567890\",
    \"subject\": \"Order inquiry\",
    \"message\": \"I have a question about my recent order...\"
}"
</code></pre></div>


<div class="javascript-example">
    <pre><code class="language-javascript">const url = new URL(
